[statement]
As `a-sole-candidate-with-a-real-dependency-is-installed-first`, with `kw`
depending on `s`, a name only `s1` provides: `w` waits its turn after `v`,
which goes to `gk`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v w

P:kw
V:1
p:v w=1
D:s

P:s1
V:1
p:s=1

P:gk
V:1
p:v
k:100


[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install gk 1
install s1 1
install kw 1
install app 1
